@startuml storage-layout
title M-CB4: persistent storage / runtime socket - broker v0, design only

component "swarma-credential-broker daemon\nunprivileged service UID\nLaunchDaemon UserName / systemd User" as Broker
component "Owner / operator CLI\npinned unmanaged OS principal" as Operator
component "swarma-dispatcher\nown service OS account" as Dispatcher
component "curator-run\nactive agent UID + generation" as Executor
component "swarma-user-manager\nroot; ledger publisher" as Helper
component "Approved Codex executable\nbroker UID; pinned digest; slice 1" as Codex

folder "Broker service home: /opt/swarma/services/swarma-credential-broker\nbroker UID owns all files; directories 0700 (§15.1-§15.2)" as Home {
  artifact "Configuration\nprincipal pins, approved endpoints/executables, root public keys" as Config
  artifact "Account records\nmetadata only; vendor ID, state, expiry (possibly unknown)" as Accounts
  artifact "Secret store\n0600 files in 0700 directory\nClaude setup-token / API or business tokens" as Secrets
  folder "Fresh broker-owned Codex home (slice 1)" as CodexHome {
    artifact "Vendor login\naccess + refresh material, file credential storage" as Login
  }
  artifact "Stable lock beside Codex home\nread / refresh / reload serialisation" as Lock
  artifact "Grant envelopes\nsigned public authorisation metadata" as Grants
  artifact "Revocation state {seq, records}\nauthoritative local state" as Revocations
  artifact "Binding records\nUID + generation; lease/caller chains + intersection" as Bindings
  artifact "Lease records\nowner tuple + launch/policy metadata; NEVER payload" as Leases
  artifact "Append-only audit log\ntyped principal/account/launch/outcome metadata\nno material, raw frames, secret errors or token hashes" as Audit
}

folder "Runtime socket directory: /opt/swarma/run/credential-broker/\nbroker UID; 0755; ancestors root-owned, not writable by others" as Runtime {
  artifact "Unix-domain socket\n0666; authorisation by kernel peer principal\nsocket basename unspecified in spec §15.2" as Socket
}
artifact "Helper ledger: /opt/swarma/lib/user-manager/ledger.json\nroot-owned 0644, root-owned directory; no secrets\nconfigured installation root changes this locator (§4.2)" as Ledger

Operator --> Socket : administrative methods
Dispatcher --> Socket : bind / unbind
Executor --> Socket : fresh agent-side lease connection
Socket --> Broker : broker/1; no network listener
Broker --> Config : read configuration
Broker --> Accounts : account metadata
Broker --> Secrets : put / get / delete / describe (§5.3)
Broker --> Grants : signed grants
Broker --> Revocations : publish under shared state lock (§6.4)
Broker --> Bindings : bind / unbind records
Broker --> Leases : persist without payload (§8.3)
Broker --> Audit : append (§12.3)
Broker --> Lock : internal per-account auth owner locks
Broker --> Codex : approved enrolment / refresh only
Codex --> Login : vendor writes broker-owned login
Helper --> Ledger : atomic replacement + flush / rename / directory flush
Broker --> Ledger : direct read at bind / lease / renew; never home fallback

note bottom of Home
  State files replaced atomically within their own directory (§12.4).
  Revocations: temp write, flush, rename, directory flush, update memory,
  then acknowledgement under lock shared with material release (§6.4).
  Audit append-only is separate from state-file replacement (§12.3).
  Except the helper ledger, basenames and split of files/directories
  unspecified in spec §5.3 / §12.4 / §15.2; boxes are logical records.
  Modes for non-secret state files unspecified in spec §12.4;
  no claimed 0600 blanket beyond the specified secret backend.
  [[../spec/broker.md#53-secret-store Spec §5.3]]
  [[../spec/broker.md#124-files Spec §12.4]]
end note
note right of Broker
  Startup refuses if store/config or any parent directory is writable
  by another user (§12.4). Kernel peer identity unavailable: refuse (§4.1).
  Revocation read/parse failure: all leases/renewals refuse until
  operator repairs; never restart from empty state (§6.4).
  Ledger mismatch/read failure: principal_ledger_mismatch (§4.2).
  Repair command, crash replay and audit write-failure response:
  unspecified in spec §6.4 / §12.3-§12.4.
end note
note bottom of Runtime
  Socket lives outside the data tree; clients verify broker peer UID
  before sending. Socket mode is access, not authority (§4.1).
  Lease payload travels only to executor/harness; no launch credential file.
  [[../spec/broker.md#152-paths Spec §15.2]]
end note
note right of CodexHome
  Only auth owner uses this home; refresh token never leaves broker (§9).
  No imported home/login or exported keyring item (§9.2).
  Transient failure: backoff while token valid; rejected refresh:
  owner re-enrols; stopped owner: refuse (§9.4).
  Restart-to-active procedure unspecified in spec §9.4.
  Launch app-server runs under agent UID with ephemeral credentials,
  no launch auth.json; account storage above is a separate boundary (§9.3).
end note
note left of Home
  Uninstall: stop service, end leases/bindings, keep store unless
  operator requests destruction (§15.3). Removal/secure-erasure
  algorithm, audit retention and garbage collection unspecified
  in spec §15.3 / §12.3. Copied tokens need expiry/vendor revoke (§12.1).
  [[../spec/broker.md#153-removal Spec §15.3]]
end note
note top of Operator
  Software-root private key: local operator custody (§4.3);
  persistence locator unspecified in spec §4.3, not placed in broker store.
  Keychain / Secret Service later, not v0 (§5.3).
  Keeper adapter later; Codex slice 1 still pending qualification (§18.4).
  SH1/SH2 activation unspecified in spec §3.1.
end note
@enduml
